nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jwE9MhU8ZcYQ7kNvwHsBToW&_nc_oc=AdpfWCsVBpNj7-XENpAJXzmVvW8ltqK64e2wKTkwoDAzGdRLfDemn1scOo1lw2LtlSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy80VRA5EVfrCt0MLxr_REP2AGveHIPnWi9pcPNlw6YVg&oe=69CA6464"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "879363444937419", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_879363448270752_400143134733280957_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vWHAbj3HWqoQ7kNvwFzaygH&_nc_oc=AdpZJq1hacslivu900_2FLHjdlSR4yxNVvrFBnQvyjarvcXIVFL31V97T9r4MIgwSe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxm40rkU1PB7i6eVKyn7vk793inAWRAa3v-RV4j6UaIgA&oe=69CA8034"}, "display_name": "Ape Skate Shootout", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "ape", "skate", "hangout"], "long_description": "Shoot. Skate. Toot. \n\nCome hang out at the Skate Park, where you can slide down half pipes and pull off sweet tricks while hanging out with your friends - and grab a gun to mow them down. \n\nIn Ape Skate Shootout you can : \n- Complete skateboard tricks and stunts to earn SkateCash, used to upgrade your character or the Skate Park itself\n- Charge your farts observing your gas meter, and use them to boost around the Skate Park (or to disrespect your fallen foes). \n- Find a variety of weapons to mow down other players and compete in tense deathmatches\n- Combine wacky gadgets and upgrade combos to become the sickest Ape on the half-pipe. \n- Private and public lobby codes to join friends easier\n\nFeaturing a unique locomotion system that's easy to learn and difficult to master, and simple gunplay mechanics with a varied upgrade system, every match of Ape Skate Shootout will feel completely different. ", "short_description": "Kick Ass and Pass Gas - Shoot, skate and toot your way around the Skate Park pulling off tricks and eliminating your opponents. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_